# Files that stay OUT of the packaged .zxp.
#
# Shared deliberately: build-zxp.sh stages with --exclude-from=this, and CI's
# package-drift check stages the same way before diffing against the committed
# zxp. Two copies of this list would drift and the check would report phantom
# differences.
.debug
.zxpignore
install-mac.sh
install-win.bat
build-zxp.sh
*.md
test
package.json
node_modules
